    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu ne ba wandaaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amenya mu sibala nisio raraawe auyilamo, sibala sia Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno nilwo lukano lwe luuya lwa Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu ne ali ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko ekhumi na saba ayaanga kumunyele ne bawandaaye, babaana ba Biliia ne Silipa, bakhasi ba raraawe. Yosefu aboolela raraawe kamabi niko bawandaaye bakholanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli aaba asiima Yosefu khukhila babaana bewe boosi, sikila aaba omwana niye asaala ne asaakhulue. Mala amunabila engubo endeeyi eye kamakhono kamaleeyi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "engubo endeeyi eye kamakhono kamaleeyi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "engubo eye kamakhono kamaleeyi, namwe engubo eye kamapala.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kasiimisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga bawandaaye babona bali paapa wabwe asiima Yosefu khukhilakho nibo boosi, bamubiila mala khulomaloma naye mu muleembe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siilo silala, Yosefu aroora, ne nga aboolela bawandaaye kamarooro kewe batasa khumubiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababoolela ali, “Rekeeresia muboolele kamarooro niko ndoorire kano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khubeele khulikho khuboa binywa mu mukuunda mala nabona sinywa siase sienyokha siema bukololofu, ne binywa bienywe biebuusia biabotookhelela sisiase, mala biasisikamila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaaye bamureeba bali, “Ng'ali ewe olaba omwami mala okhwamiie efwe?” Nio batasa khumubiila lukali sikila kamarooro ne kamakhuwa kewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu aroora kamarooro kakaandi mala aboolela bawandaaye ali, “Lola, ndoorire kamarooro kakaandi, mala mboone, enyanga, kumwesi ne ching'enieesi ekhumi ne ndala abele bilikho bisikamila ese.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga akaboolela raraawe ne bawandaaye, raraawe amuyibila mala amureeba ali, “Kamarooro lukano siina niko oroorire kano? Ewe wibaasia oli ese, ne maao ne bawandaayo khukheche khwiname asi ebweeni wowo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mala bawandaaye bamukhendekhela, ne kakhali raraawe amenya ne liboola lino mu mebaasio kewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu akusibwa mala ayilwa e Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo ndala bawandaaye ba Yosefu basamusia bibiaayo bia paapa wabwe mumayilwe siimbi ne Shekemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Isiraeli aboolela Yosefu ali, “Bawandaayo se basamuusie bibiaayo e Shekemu ta ku? Yiicha khurume khu nibo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu akobosia ali, “Yee, ese ndi ano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio raraawe amuboolela ali, “Khoche, mala obone bawandaayo ne bali bulayi lundi obone bibiaayo undeerere likhuwa.” Nio raraawe amuruma khukhwama mu litooma lia Heburoni acha ola e Shekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu okundi amunyoola mundaa ne alikho acha eyi ne neeyi mala amureeba ali, “Olikho oenja siina?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukobosia ali, “Ndikho mbenja bawandaayase, khusaba umboolele niio balikho baaya bibiaayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo aloma ali, “Barekuukhe, sikila mbuliile ne baloma bali khekhuche e Dotani.” Nio, Yosefu aloonda khu bawandaaye abanyoola e Dotani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubona ne asiili ataayi ne akhaboolakho tawe mala bamwikuta bali bamwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baboolana babeene ne babeene bali, “Namarooro oyosi alikho echa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiicha khumwire mala khumumwaate mu lilala khu maloo kano mala khuche khuboole khuli esolo eye mundaa emuliile, nio khubone nga kamarooro kewe kacha khuba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Rubeni aulila lino, akhaka khumuonia, ababoolela ali, “Khukhamwiira tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukhachukha sifuki tawe, mumwaate busa mwiloo lie mu sichiimi lino, ne kakhali mukhamutilakho tawe.” Rubeni enya khumuonia, nio amukobosie khu raraawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Yosefu ne ola khu bawandaaye, bamufuula engubo eye kamakhono kamaleeyi ne kamapala esiimisia, niyo aaba ne afwarire eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuaamba bamumwaata mwiloo. Liloo se liabamo kameechi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne bekhala asi, baaba ne balia, babona Baisimaeli balikho bama Kileati ne chingamia chabwe bekha e Misiri. Baba basutile ekamu, kamafura ne manemane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda aboolela bawandaaye ali, “Lili na bukhala sina khwire wandaayefwe mala khukise sifuki siewe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khekhumukusie khu Baisimaeli. Khukhamuyilakho kamakhono kiefwe tawe sikila ali wandaayefwe, lundi ali kamafuki kefwe ne enyama eye kumubili kwefwe.” Mala bawandaaye bafukiilila kakeewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne nga Bamidiani baboofuli baba ne balikho babira siimbi, bawandaaye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37.28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "bawandaaye:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lueburania luli nibo (Bamidiani).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bakhweesa Yosefu bamurusia mwiloo mala bamukusia khu Baisimaeli khulwe bitonyi kamakhumi kabili bie efwesa mala bamuyila e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Rubeni akobola sie loo mala alola khubonamo Yosefu tawe, atabula chingubo chewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala akobola khu bawandaaye abareeba ali, “Omusoleeli se ali mwiloo tawe, aba ese ndacha waena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beera embusi, mala babukula engubo eya Yosefu basiikha mu malasile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayila engubo eye kamapala kasiimisia khu paapa wabwe, baloma bali, “Khunyoolile engubo yino, kilole ne eli eyo omwana wowo namwe tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimanya mala aloma ali, “Eli engubo eyo omwana wase! Esolo eye mundaa yamuliile, ndi nang'ali ndi esolo yatabulaake Yosefu mu bitonyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo atabula chingubo mala afwara likunia munda mala alila omwana wewe khulwe chindaalo chingali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaana bewe basoleeli ne bakhaana benyokha bacha khumuoleelesia, ne kakhali aloba khuolelesibwa mala aloma ali, “Tawe ndekhe enje emakoombe khu mwana wase ne siliila busa ndi,” raraawe achiililila khumulila ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Bamidiani baba bamukusiisie mu Misiri khu Potifa, omukhulu owe kamae ka Farao kakamuliindanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
